# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
# A nested build/ from a misconfigured Xcode derived-data path has been
# accidentally committed under assets/Fonts/ and android/ before (see CI-11) —
# ignore build/ at any depth, not just the root, so it can't recur silently.
**/build/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json


